cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ThermoChemX, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "ThermoChemX: redox-aware bulk compositions for Perple_X thermodynamic modeling"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/micbukala/ThermoChemX"
url: "https://github.com/micbukala/ThermoChemX"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform desktop application that converts whole-rock analyses into
  Perple_X-ready bulk compositions (mol/kg) with explicit Fe, C and S redox
  partitioning, automated volatile handling, phantom-oxygen correction,
  a runtime mass-closure check and re-importable composition snapshots,
  in both the element and the oxide basis.
keywords:
  - thermodynamic modeling
  - phase equilibria
  - Perple_X
  - redox
  - Deep Earth Water
  - petrology
  - geochemistry
